{"id":"pcw-review-grok","parent":"prop-op-conditional-was","ord":"a1","title":"review 1/2: grok (split)","done":"2026-08-25T22:30:33-04:00","after":["pcw-implement"],"created":"2026-08-25T21:19:56-04:00","changed":"2026-08-25T22:30:44-04:00","custom":{"retired":"2026-08-25T22:32:00-04:00","reviewer":"agent-grok","terminal":"cef58672","verdict":"FOLD — no MUST; 2 SHOULDs (the two-writes reopen shape; apply's was-failure as itself, the #396 twin); his own #401 flag verified discharged verbatim. PR comment on #404."}}
