{"id":"lane-camera-review-opus","parent":"chat-camera-capture","ord":"a3","title":"review: claude-opus","done":"2026-08-27T15:36:00-04:00","after":["lane-camera-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-27T15:02:31-04:00","changed":"2026-08-27T15:36:03-04:00","custom":{"terminal":"b4c5f5de","verdict":"approve with changes — 1 MUST (the multi-shot scenario cannot catch a dropped value-clearing: Playwright's injected setFiles never reads input.value; assert inputValue===\"\" or fix the comment — same finding as grok's SHOULD, independently), 2 SHOULD (dismissed-capture guard uncovered incl. the roll-picker behaviour change; pick-step accept locator ambiguous on phone), 3 NIT; pressed-and-clean on the coarse-pointer reactivity, image/* refusal path, a11y"}}
